{"batch_number":29,"batch_size":70,"cases":[{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-015","input":"由于州以下的各级数据和特征数据是重点，因此国会席位分配数据完成后能在第一时间开始分析。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-015","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-037","input":"人口普查局将密切注意 2020 年人口普查的成效以及不同地域和人口群组人数的统计情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-037","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-013","input":"包括所有截至 4 月 1 日在您的住宅生活和留宿的人，即使他们暂时住在别的地方也要算上他们。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-013","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-020","input":"住房单元的当前居民。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-020","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-016","input":"这些工作人员与社区组织合作，讲解回答 2020 年人口普查调查有多么容易、安全和重要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-016","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-019","input":"将为他们发放个人防护装备，并将遵循当地的使用指南准则。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-019","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-028","input":"在过去的几个月里，CPEP 的宣传工作主要是通过虚拟的方式进行，以支持留在住宅的命令和社交疏离要求。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-028","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-002","input":"计划明信片将在人口普查员开始拜访尚未回答住户的几个星期之前 7 月 22 日到 7 月 28 日期间送达。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-002","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-005","input":"国家约 61.7% 的住户自从邀请在 3 月 12 日开始送达邮政信箱后已经通过在线、电话或邮件回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-005","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-09-sentence-004","input":"我们鼓励住户在收到邀请邮包后尽快回答 2020 年人口普查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-postcards/2020-postcards-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-09-sentence-004","split":"press_release_09"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"本指南概括介绍了如何在家中、工作场所、公共场所和网上保持安全。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"能够识别在哪些情况下容易受到攻击可有效避免此类情况发生或在面临威胁时做好准备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"即使仅离开几分钟，也一定要关闭车窗，拿走贵重物品并锁好车。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-046","input":"向警方提供任何监控录像、手机视频或照片，因为这可能有助于调查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-046","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-049","input":"在让访客进入您家之前，请务必确认其身份。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-049","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-098","input":"此外，始终确保您的车辆有足够的燃料（如果是电动车，则有足够的电量）供您完成旅程。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-098","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-106","input":"请只从信誉良好的“应用程序商店”安装应用程序，以避免潜在的有害下载。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-106","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-115","input":"确保您使用的应用程序具有端到端加密功能。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-115","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-121","input":"请监测您发布的信息，并负责任地发布信息，从而确保不会有人因您公开的信息而面临风险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-121","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1/sentence-127","input":"针对人肉搜索的法律因辖区而异，因此在考虑预防和缓解方案时，一定要查阅所在地区的相关法律。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/2025-03/personal-security-considerations-action-guide-critical-infrastructure-workers_06-07-2024_508_ZHS.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-127","split":"guide"},"source_id":"cisa-personal-security-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-001","input":"在灾后清理以及重建时确保工人安全自然灾害可能导致洪水的大范围泛滥，并对财产和基础设施造成破坏。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-007","input":"我们将会给您提供帮助。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-015","input":"使用防水靴、乳胶或橡胶手套和其他防护服装。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-019","input":"倾倒的电线接触与倒下的电力线相连接的线或物体（包括树枝）会有灼伤和触电的危险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-022","input":"与所有倒下的电力线路保持至少10英尺（3米）的距离。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-038","input":"在湿滑且不平坦的作业面，工人可能会因滑倒、绊倒和跌倒而造成伤害。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-044","input":"发电机废气中有毒的一氧化碳(CO)。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-044","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-051","input":"穿着符合ANSI/ISEA 107-2004标准的高反光服装和安全帽。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-051","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-056","input":"施工活动在拆除房屋和建筑物时，接触被石棉污染的材料。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-056","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1/sentence-071","input":"如果工人认为他们的雇主没有遵守OSHA标准或存在严重的危险，他们可以提出投诉、让OSHA检查他们的工作场所。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.osha.gov/sites/default/files/publications/OSHA_FS-4355.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-071","split":"document"},"source_id":"osha-disaster-cleanup-simplified-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"选择效率更高、性能更佳的设备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"如果自动泵不用水时会打开和关闭，则说明在漏水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"定期检查自动洒水系统和计时装置，确保能正常运行。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"将割草机刀片升高到至少三英寸或最高水平。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"种植抗旱的草种。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-050","input":"刷牙、洗脸或剃须时，不要让水不停地流。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-050","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-052","input":"自动洗碗机装满了再洗。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-052","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-054","input":"手动洗碗时，用两个容器放满水，一个放肥皂水，另一个放含少量氯漂白剂的漂洗水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-054","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-064","input":"如果土壤仍然潮湿，则无需浇水。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-064","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1/sentence-072","input":"使用利用回收水的商用洗车场。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/drought","source_case_id":"sentence-072","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-drought-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"烟雾和毒气比火焰造成的死亡人数更多。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"如果主要通道被火焰或烟雾挡住，要找两种离开每个房间的方法。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"确保窗户不会卡住，纱窗能快速取下，安全栏能正确打开。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"在厨房放一个灭火器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"如果出现浓烟或火灾，准备好迅速关门。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"告诉急救人员此人所在地方。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/home-fires","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"},"source_id":"ready-gov-home-fires-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible"